  "segments": [
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.2,
    "text": "As a heart surgeon, what are the things"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 2.2,
    "end": 5.08,
    "text": "you absolutely avoid?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 5.08,
    "end": 6.64,
    "text": "Smoking's top of the list."
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 6.64,
    "end": 10.94,
    "text": "I mean, I cannot come up with one single thing"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 10.94,
    "end": 15.74,
    "text": "that does as much damage to every organ in the body"
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 15.74,
    "end": 17.58,
    "text": "as smoking cigarettes."
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 17.58,
    "end": 20.12,
    "text": "And look, it's incredibly addictive."
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 20.12,
    "end": 23.42,
    "text": "And I know that and I pass no judgment"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 23.42,
    "end": 25.24,
    "text": "because I know how difficult it is."
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 25.24,
    "end": 26.54,
    "text": "I've been dealing with patients"
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 26.54,
    "end": 28.58,
    "text": "that are chronic smokers for years."
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 28.58,
    "end": 30.02,
    "text": "I understand that."
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 30.02,
    "end": 32.66,
    "text": "that doesn't change the fact"
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 32.66,
    "end": 34.98,
    "text": "that it is the single most dangerous thing"
   },
   {
    "id": "t15",
    "start": 34.98,
    "end": 35.82,
    "text": "you can do for yourself."
   },
   {
    "id": "t16",
    "start": 35.82,
    "end": 38.82,
    "text": "Not to mention the causal relationship with lung cancer"
   },
   {
    "id": "t17",
    "start": 38.82,
    "end": 40.6,
    "text": "and I could keep going."
   },
   {
    "id": "t18",
    "start": 40.6,
    "end": 43.7,
    "text": "So it's probably one, two and three"
   },
   {
    "id": "t19",
    "start": 43.7,
    "end": 45.62,
    "text": "on the list to begin with."
   }
  ]
 },
